# Combined PDF with PNGs

When this project generates PNG files, also leave a single review PDF in the same folder. Do not write a second PDF of the same pages.

- Anchor review: `anchor.pdf` (already written by preprocess). Do not also stitch `pageNN.png` into `combined.pdf`.
- MC question crops (`qN.png`): write `combined.pdf` through `scripts/png_pdf.py` (`combine_pngs_to_pdf`). Portrait A4, year/Q labels, original paper (no blue dots). Overwrite when the PNGs are regenerated. Crop the left edge at the anchor. It skips an existing output PDF unless overwrite is set.
- LQ answer crops: same PNG-to-A4 helper (`combine_pngs_to_pdf` / `place_pngs_on_a4`).
- LQ question reviews (`output/lq/<year>/combined.pdf`, `questions.pdf`, and classified `questions.pdf`) come from source Paper 1B pages via `scripts/lq_pdf_review.py`. Do not stitch `qN.png` into those PDFs.
- Point the user at the existing review PDF, not a list of PNGs.
